    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Quickly and effectively lift surface stains from teeth.<br\/>✔ Powerful tongue brusher<br\/>✔ Targets built-up residue between teeth<br\/>✔ 100% Waterproof<br\/>✔ 4 Interchangeable cleaning heads for all oral care needs.<br\/>✔ High frequency vibration<br\/>✔ Bright LED auxiliary light to ensure you can see and reach those hard to tackle areas.<br\/>✔ Built in rechargeable battery<br\/>✔ Clears away up to 99.99% of visible food residue.<br\/>✔ Adaptable to different teeth sensitivities with various modes.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the electric dental cleaning kit?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Select your desired attachment based on your oral needs.<\/p><p>2. Turn on the device and alter between modes based on your cleaning needs.<\/p><p>3. Alter between heads if necessary.<\/p><p>4. Clean the device and the tip after use. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>The all-in-one dental cleaning kit consists of all necessary parts to save you trips to the dentists.<\/p><p>Each package includes:<\/p><p>1 x Cordless Electric Toothbrush<\/p><p>4 x Attachment Heads (plaque remover,  tongue brusher, toothbrush and flosser)<\/p><p>1 x Dental Tooth Mirror<\/p><p>1x Stainless Steel Pick<\/p><p>1 x USB Charger<\/p><p>1 x Instruction Manual<\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>✘ Not recommended for Children under the age of 12.<br\/><br\/>✔ Please make sure to wash your mouth with warm water after use.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner Pro be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner Pro is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. It is specifically engineered to be safe and effective on various dental materials. The device uses gentle ultrasonic vibrations to remove plaque and tartar without damaging the surface of your dental restorations, ensuring a thorough clean while maintaining the integrity of your composite bonding, veneers, and fillings.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
